      "=== Reponse du modele (2 execution(s) de code) ===\n",
      "En utilisant un calcul exact sur les fractions, on obtient :\n",
      "\n",
      "\\[\n",
      "\\begin{cases}\n",
      "2x+3y-z=1\\\\\n",
      "4x+y+2z=2\\\\\n",
      "-x+2y+3z=3\n",
      "\\end{cases}\n",
      "\\]\n",
      "\n",
      "La solution est :\n",
