      "=\\frac{4+84-35}{53}\n",
      "=\\frac{53}{53}=1\n",
      "\\]\n",
      "\n",
      "2. Deuxième équation :\n",
      "\n",
      "\\[\n",
      "4\\cdot\\frac{2}{53}+\\frac{28}{53}+2\\cdot\\frac{35}{53}\n",
      "=\\frac{8+28+70}{53}\n",
      "=\\frac{106}{53}=2\n",
      "\\]\n",
